Package: watersofcasablanca
Type: Project
Title: The Waters of Casablanca: On Political Misinformation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Robert C.", "Luskin", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com"))
Description: Data, analyses, and manuscript for a paper that separates
    misinformation from knowledge, mere belief, and ignorance and compares
    multiple-choice items with a 0-10 probability scale in four randomized
    survey experiments.
